%% Sequence: Citation Sentinel RAG Flow
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Writer
    participant FE as React + Tiptap
    participant GW as FastAPI Gateway
    participant CIT as Citation Sentinel
    participant VS as Vector Search
    participant DB as Postgres + pgvector
    participant AI as AIService (Gemini)
    participant MR as Margin Repository

    U->>FE: Selects paragraph + clicks "Verify Claim"
    FE->>GW: POST /citation-sentinel/verify<br/>{project_id, paragraph_id, claim_text}
    GW->>GW: JWT + rate limit
    GW->>CIT: verify_claim()
    CIT->>CIT: Extract atomic claims<br/>from paragraph
    CIT->>VS: retrieve_top_k(claim_embedding, k=5)
    VS->>DB: SELECT chunks ORDER BY<br/>embedding <=> claim_embedding<br/>LIMIT 5
    DB-->>VS: top 5 PDF chunks<br/>with source metadata
    VS-->>CIT: retrieved_evidence[]
    CIT->>AI: Verify claim against evidence<br/>(prompt template: [Lens: Sceptical Examiner])
    AI-->>CIT: {verdict: "partially_supported",<br/>supported_claims: [...],<br/>unsupported_claims: [...],<br/>citations: [chunk_ids]}
    CIT->>MR: persist intervention<br/>(type=citation, verdict, citations)
    MR->>DB: INSERT intervention +<br/>intervention_evidence junction
    CIT-->>GW: {verdict, citations,<br/>intervention_id}
    GW-->>FE: 200 OK + verdict payload
    FE->>FE: Render verdict card in Living Margin<br/>with clickable chunk references
    FE-->>U: Margin shows:<br/>"Partially Supported" +<br/>3 source passages highlighted
    U->>FE: Clicks source passage
    FE->>GW: GET /pdfs/{pdf_id}/chunks/{chunk_id}
    GW-->>FE: chunk_text + page_number
    FE-->>U: Modal displays source passage
